            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.1.1+JOB.1.2+JOB.1.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yubu 1.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot odwoko gum pa Yubu, i kare ma en doŋ olego pi lureme; omiyo bote lim ma dodo maca ma yam en tye kwede ryen aryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumeno omegine ki Iumegine ki jo ma guŋeyo wacon, gucamo cam bo te i ode. Gunyuto cwercwinygi bote, gukweyo cwinye pi gin marac ducu ma yam Rwot okelo i kome. Dano acel acel i kingi omiye dul lim ki agit jabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot omiyo gum ki Yubu i agikki me kwone makato i acakkine. En obedo ki romi alip apar wiye aŋwen, kinaga alip abicel, twoni pur alip aryo, ki megi kana alip acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedo bene ki awobe abiro ki anyira adek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ocako nyiŋ nyako mukwoŋone ni Yemima, nyiŋ me aryone Kejia, ki nyiŋ me adekke Kerenapuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I lobo meno ducu pe onoŋo tye iye mon ma yam gibeco calo anyira pa Yubu; wongi opoko botgi ginaleya i kin omegigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen i ŋe lok meno ducu Yubu ori i lobo dok mwaka miya acel ki pyeraŋwen, ci oneno awobene ki litino pa awobene, yalwak me aŋwen kulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Yubu oto muti adada, ma onoŋo karene bene doŋ oromo maber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
